GAL22V10
OVFEQ

CLK   P0    P1    P2    P3    P4    P5    P6    P7    Q0   Q1   GND
Q2    Q3    Q4    Q5    Q6    Q7    NC    NC    EQ    NC   NC   VCC

; Flattened 16 product terms onto pin 22 (edge, max 8) must fail.
EQ = P0 * /Q0 + /P0 * Q0 +
     P1 * /Q1 + /P1 * Q1 +
     P2 * /Q2 + /P2 * Q2 +
     P3 * /Q3 + /P3 * Q3 +
     P4 * /Q4 + /P4 * Q4 +
     P5 * /Q5 + /P5 * Q5 +
     P6 * /Q6 + /P6 * Q6 +
     P7 * /Q7 + /P7 * Q7

DESCRIPTION
Intentional product-term overflow for harness negative test.
